# Docs are not versioned.
#
# Two of these fight every merge: the PDF and DOCX are binaries git cannot
# combine, and the Postman collection is one 6,800-line JSON that every
# feature branch edits. The scripts that generate them are committed, which
# is the part worth sharing.
#
# privacy-enquiries.export.json also lived here and holds real submissions.
# Removing it from HEAD does not remove it from history — see commit 6d83481.
docs/
